WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The order says chips. The plate has salad.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
I ordered chips, not salad.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Could you replace the salad with chips, please?

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Replace the salad with chips.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Grilled fish with chips, right?

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
A burger with a side salad, not onion rings.
